es that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","title":"Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","type":"topic"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/accessibilityRotorEntry(id:in:)":{"title":"accessibilityRotorEntry(id:in:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/accessibilityRotorEntry(id:in:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"accessibilityRotorEntry","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"ID","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ID","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"in","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI9NamespaceV","text":"Namespace","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI9NamespaceV2IDV","text":"ID","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/accessibilityrotorentry(id:in:)","kind":"symbol"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView","title":"Interaction_DragView","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drags a layer in any direction with momentum and rubber-band bounds. The draggable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card responds to touch input via Origami’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.Drag"},{"type":"text","text":" patch, which wires its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"output "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Position"},{"type":"text","text":" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card snaps back to its resting position."}]}}}